'' 'len' OF A NAME THROUGH A NAMESPACE MEASURES THE OBJECT (2026-10-11). Every qualified
'' string, zstring, wstring and string field folded to its size -- 'len( stamp.sg )' over
'' "hello" printed 24 -- because a dotted path whose leftmost name was a namespace was taken
'' for a static one, as 'T.field' over a type is. The expected output is fbc-modern's,
'' run on this program; the constant and the type's members stay static, and sizeof is
'' unchanged.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.nml
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/namespace-member-len.bas -o build/.nml/nml.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: build/.nml/nml.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5 3 4 7 8
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5 24 4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  24 20 40 24 4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5 7
